data: {"query":"他有哪些论文","query_type":"canonical_v2:A:answer","answer_text":"你问的这篇论文是《Ultra-high sensitivity Fabry–Perot interferometer gas refractive index fiber sensor based on photonic crystal fiber and Vernier effect》，作者为 Mingran Quan、Jiajun Tian、Yong Yao，2015 年发表于 Optics Letters。该工作提出并验证了一种基于光子晶体光纤与 Vernier 效应的开腔法布里–珀罗干涉仪气体折射率传感器，实测折射率灵敏度高达 30899 nm/RIU，可用于气体浓度分析与湿度监测等场景。\n\n与这篇论文同属一个研究方向（光纤传感、Vernier 效应、光子学器件）的相关论文还包括：\n\n- 《High-sensitivity relative humidity fiber-optic sensor based on an internal–external Fabry–Perot cavity Vernier effect》，作者 Cheng Zhou、Qian Zhou、Bo Wang、Jiajun Tian、Yong Yao，2021 年发表于 Optics Express，采用内–外法布里–珀罗腔 Vernier 效应结合壳聚糖薄膜实现高灵敏相对湿度传感，灵敏度达 7.15 nm/% RH。\n- 《Reversal of optical binding force by Fano resonance in plasmonic nanorod heterodimer》，作者 Q. Zhang、Jun‐Jun Xiao、X. M. Zhang、Yong Yao、Hui Liu，2013 年发表于 Optics Express，研究等离激元纳米棒异二聚体中 Fano 共振引起的光学结合力反转。\n- 《An Ultra-Compact 3-dB Power Splitter for Three Modes Based on Pixelated Meta-Structure》，作者 Hucheng Xie、Yingjie Liu、Yuhan Wang、Yujie Wang、Yong Yao、Qinghai Song，2020 年发表于 IEEE Photonics Technology Letters，提出基于像素化超结构的超紧凑三模 3-dB 功率分束器。\n- 《High-speed silicon photonic Mach–Zehnder modulator at 2 μm》，作者 Xi Wang、Weihong Shen、Wenxiang Li、Yingjie Liu、Yong Yao、Jiangbing Du，2021 年发表于 Photonics Research，报道了面向 2 μm 波段的高速硅基马赫–曾德尔调制器，调制速率可达 80 Gbit/s。\n\n以上是与该论文主题关联较紧密的几篇。如果你关注的是某位具体作者（如 Yong Yao、Jiajun Tian）的完整论文列表，可以告诉我，我再帮你进一步梳理。","citations":[{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-23703260af8b9901","label":"Ultra-high sensitivity Fabry–Perot interferometer gas refractive index fiber sensor based on photonic crystal fiber and Vernier effect","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/ol.40.004891"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-c0eed461b00a962d","label":"Reversal of optical binding force by Fano resonance in plasmonic nanorod heterodimer","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/oe.21.006601"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-667a8a2afcc1934c","label":"An Ultra-Compact 3-dB Power Splitter for Three Modes Based on Pixelated Meta-Structure","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/lpt.2020.2975128"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-39c1c3b2e0f344b1","label":"High-speed silicon photonic Mach–Zehnder modulator at 2 μm","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/prj.417107"},{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-eeb260ab2b702a8a","label":"High-sensitivity relative humidity fiber-optic sensor based on an internal–external Fabry–Perot cavity Vernier effect","url":"https://doi.org/10.1364/oe.421060"}],"evidence":[],"clarification":null,"structured_payload":{},"answer_style":"llm_synthesized","citation_map":{"1":"official-source-23703260af8b9901","2":"official-source-c0eed461b00a962d","3":"official-source-667a8a2afcc1934c","4":"official-source-39c1c3b2e0f344b1","5":"official-source-eeb260ab2b702a8a"},"suggested_followups":[]}

